Description:
 linuxmuster-linbo7 - linuxmuster-linbo7
Changes:
 linuxmuster-linbo7 (7.4.21) lmn74; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(rsync-post-upload): drop the dead empty-BAKDIR cleanup after a
     failed upload (#133, fd29b93).
   * feat(linbo_create_image): create a base image under a new name
     (#133, 866eef6).
   * feat(rsync-pre-upload): accept image uploads only from registered
     devices (#133, c04f422).
   * feat(rsync-pre-upload): leave image uploads of other schools unchecked
     (#133, c7250bc).
   * feat(rsync-pre-upload): guard image uploads under a new name
     (#133, b2b3f6a).
   * feat(rsync-post-upload): take over the supplemental files of the
     source image (#133, 4d70dc2).
   * feat(linbo-remote, linbo_wrapper): create and upload images under a
     new name (#133, 9bcbbd3).
   * fix(linbo-remote): name a surplus field instead of an unknown empty
     command (#133, 446256f).
   * fix(linbo_upload): report failed uploads as failed (#198, d8d57ff).
   * feat(init.sh): show the progress of onboot commands in the splash
     (#199, 9ab96b4).
   * feat(init.sh): log failed onboot commands and skip the remaining ones
     (#199, a2be6c2).
   * fix(linbo_upload, linbo_create_image): never upload an incomplete image
     (#199, dea35d6).
